{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56573","headline":"九转诗 一 · 窦真君","name":"九转诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岩叟承恩宠，烧丹在禁闱。\n釜中诸药化，鑪上水银飞。\n璧合秋霜色，光含夜月辉。\n緫由明主感，能使道精微。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦真君","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}